        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos Invasion is a 2D ROGUE shooter game. The player takes on the role of a special drone, capable of simultaneously controlling up to 51 weapons and 9 items, to eliminate endless monsters until death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2145, humanity made a significant breakthrough in the field of quantum. They discovered a mysterious dungeon that connected different parallel universes, and upon successfully opening the portal to the parallel universe, disaster struck. Chaotic energy surged forth, followed by monsters from countless parallel universes that had been eroded. They had strange forms and diverse abilities, and the world plunged into chaos and fear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2146, the world fell into ruin. The remaining humans decided to unite with the biotechnological entities from other parallel universes and venture deep into the underground chambers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mysterious dungeon guards everything and also destroys everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequent update content:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize the underlying code. Optimize the sound effects. Optimize the monster death effects. Optimize the level selection. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add more characters. Add more ranged weapons. Add character skills. Add melee weapons. Add more monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add manual aiming. Add training grounds, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to personal reasons, the update content is expected to be fully completed within 3 to 6 months.</p>",
